      "Local Ollama chat remains CPU-bound on a hybrid Intel host.",
      "The same machine is re-used under a Windows plus WSL deployment."
    ],
    "retest_on": [
      "Ollama runtime version changes",
      "A switch to GPU or OpenVINO chat serving",
      "A Windows plus WSL deployment on the same laptop"
